stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unverified
    Unverified --> Pending: send_email_verification
    Pending --> Pending: wrong code / attempts < 3
    Pending --> Unverified: TTL 10m or third wrong attempt
    Pending --> Verified: correct code, atomic Lua
    Verified --> Unverified: TTL 30m
    Verified --> Unverified: current contact email changed
